WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.301
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Translate and Fix Your English.

2
00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:10.378
Translate text and correct your own English. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.383 --> 00:00:18.787
Step one. Ask the AI to translate your text into simple English. Paste the text after your request.

4
00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:24.934
Step two. To fix your English, say, correct my grammar. Paste your sentence.

5
00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:31.507
Step three. Then ask, explain my mistakes. This is how you learn, not only copy.

6
00:00:32.517 --> 00:00:39.293
Step four. You can also ask it to rewrite the sentence in a polite style. Always read the result and learn from it.

7
00:00:40.283 --> 00:00:44.399
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:44.699 --> 00:00:47.221
Write 3 sentences, ask AI to correct them.

9
00:00:47.521 --> 00:00:49.973
Ask AI to explain each mistake.

10
00:00:50.273 --> 00:00:52.760
Rewrite your sentences in a formal style.

11
00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:54.084
Well done!

